  "title": "Showing a document — the pieces of showing a page and enlarging a region, and their relationships",
  "titleEs": "Exhibición de documento — Mecanismo o relación explicada",
  "category": "hearings",
  "categoryName": "Audiencias y desarrollo del juicio",
