  "treatment": "mechanism",
  "family": "spatial-mechanism",
  "description": "An exploded plan of the generic hearing room: the wall clock and the exhibit cabinet (with the document lying on its exhibit) rise out of their places; the display board, the presenter at the lectern and the participants stay. Only the supplied relationships are drawn, edge to edge, with their kind. A tracer follows the supplied traversal; once it reaches the board the document settles on it as a full page with its reference (● complete document, as supplied), a frame marks the supplied region and an enlarged copy of it (lines and blocks only) grows into the zone (◆ selected detail, as supplied); both places get the same neutral frame. Fictional and illustrative; no authenticity, admissibility, weight or ruling is shown.",
